sed as a threshold in a mediaeval structure. The upper and lower cornice have been damaged. The inscription runs below the lower cornice. The framed pediment of the tympanum is empty.\u003C/p>\n                                    \u003Cmaterial ana=\"#material.inorganic.stone.sedimentary_rock.limestone.calcilutite.white.calcare-lucidabile_bianco_tipo-scaglia #material.inorganic.stone.sedimentary_rock.limestone.calcilutite.white.calcare-lucidabile_bianco_scaglia #material.inorganic.stone.sedimentary_rock.limestone.calcilutite.white.calcare-lucidabile_bianco_lattimusa\" type=\"stone.limestone.polishable.white\" subtype=\"calcare_bianco_tipo-scaglia|calcare_bianco_lattimusa|calcare_bianco_scaglia\" resp=\"#Coccato\" ref=\"http://www.eagle-network.eu/voc/material/lod/66.html\">, likely (identification based on pXRF, digital microscopy)\u003C/material>\n                                    \u003CobjectType ana=\"#object.arch_element.tympanum\" ref=\"http://www.eagle-network.eu/voc/objtyp/lod/1951.html\">tympanum\u003C/objectType>\n                                    \u003Cdimensions>\u003C!--silvestrini-->\n                                        \u003Cheight unit=\"cm\">49\u003C/height>\n                                        \u003Cwidth unit=\"cm\">108\u003C/width>\n                                        \u003Cdepth unit=\"cm\">24\u003C/depth>\n                                    \u003C/dimensions>\n                                \u003C/support>\n                                \u003Ccondition/>\n\t\t    \u003C/supportDesc>\n                            \u003ClayoutDesc>\n                                \u003Clayout>\n                                    \u003Crs ana=\"#execution.chiselled\" ref=\"http://www.eagle-network.eu/voc/writing/lod/1\">chiselled\u003C/rs>\n                                \t\u003Cdamage/>\n\t\t\t\u003C/layout>\n                            \u003C/layoutDesc>\n                        \u003C/objectDesc>\n                        \u003ChandDesc>\n  